# The rule groups of a target's peephole.peep that the schedule runs, and the
# one form of each it runs: `body` rewrites a whole body (peephole.rs), `insns` a
# run of instructions (isel/combined.rs). build.rs makes `peep::Rules` from this
# list and refuses a group the .peep has that is not here, or lacks its form.
extensions body
pushed_constants body
pushes body
narrowed_moves body
commuted body
transferred body
shuttles body
restored_copies body
fused body
far_loads body
increments body
borrows body
doubled body
narrowed_arithmetic body
zero_compares body
memory_arguments insns
paired_pushes insns
immediate_arguments insns
